So for the first time:

👉 SEI is not just mirroring temperature

SEI is not measuring:

how much shade
how long shade lasts

It’s measuring:

how evenly shade is distributed across the pond

So:

two ponds can have the same HSF
but one has shade clustered in one corner
the other has shade spread across the whole surface

👉 SEI captures that difference
👉 water temperature alone does not

